description.narrative:
Protecting the Future Phase 2: Health and Resilience Program 2025-2028.CHAI to strengthen the resilience of Mozambique’s health system and enhance its ability to deliver equitable, high-quality, and climate-resilient health services.  - Protecting the Future: Health and Resilience Program 2025: This CHAI–Ireland partnership will consolidate previous successes and embed evidence-based approaches into public sector service delivery systems, fully aligned with Government of Mozambique priorities. This will be achieved by expanding strategic partnerships, deploying high-impact innovations, and strengthening delivery systems led by the Ministry of Health (MoH).
The program will continue to focus on the following three strategic pillars:
• Program Area 1: A Healthy Beginning for the Next Generation – focused on MNCH;
• Program Area 2: Climate Resilience and Environmental Sustainability;
• Program Area 3: Public Sector Leadership and Institutional Capacity.
